{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick a spot, drop a pixel, and see what happens.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/eeadcc037085624383c9d08b927c68f2.avif?t=1757891382\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thousands of people are painting on the same grid, shaping and reshaping it in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every mark counts, whether it\u2019s part of a huge mural or just a single dot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/465711a34d409a4936d2d84bf3545b9e.avif?t=1757891382\" width=616 height=66 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udc40 Watch the canvas change live as others draw alongside you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u23f3 Place a pixel, wait for your timer, then go again - planning matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83e\udd1d Join friends or public groups to defend your space or build something bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2694\ufe0f Fight for territory, collaborate on art, or quietly slip in your own design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/2aefcfc0f3dbf316ac949ead09bb41df.avif?t=1757891382\" width=616 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The grid is open. Will you create, defend, or destroy?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946790?t=1757891382","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/7e31cfe2c295ddd810ac70d383227bf9d56140fa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757891382","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/e08064263eb2e9c128e189f9e9628170ca35ef4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757891382","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/e08064263eb2e9c128e189f9e9628170ca35ef4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757891382","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Pick a spot, drop a pixel, and see what happens.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946790/extras/eeadcc037085624383c9d08b927c68f2.avif?t=1757891382\" width=616 height=90 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Thousands of people are painting on the same grid, shaping and reshaping it in real time.</p><p class